---

<PageLayout meta={{ title: "Home" }}>
	<section>
		<h1 class="title mb-6 text-2xl sm:text-3xl">Greetings Earthling 👽</h1>
		<p class="mb-4">
			Welcome to my digital sanctuary. <br />I’m Rathin, a Software Engineer with 6 years of
			professional experience.
		</p>
		<p class="mb-4">
			I have expertise in building scalable, cloud-first web applications and microservices, for
			large enterprises and startups in Banking, Fintech & E-commerce domains.
		</p>
		<p class="mb-4">
			Primarily a backend developer specialized in Java, Spring, Python, Redis, RabbitMQ, SQL,
			NoSQL, AWS, Docker & Kubernetes, I have also worked with React and AngularJS.
		</p>
		<SocialList />
	</section>
	<section aria-label="Blog post list" class="mt-16" data-aos="fade-up">
		<h2 class="title mb-4 text-xl">My Tech Musings</h2>
		<ul class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-2">
			{
				allPostsByDate.map((p) => (
					<li class="flex flex-col gap-x-2 sm:flex-row">
						<PostPreview post={p} />
					</li>
				))
			}
		</ul>
	</section>
	<section class="mt-16" data-aos="fade-up">
		<h2 class="title mb-4 text-xl">Tech I use daily (almost)</h2>
		<!-- <ul class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-2">
